            "data": "Database ID\tNRW File identifier\tTitle\tResource Identifier\tNRW Internal Location\tNRW Internal Custodian\tOwner organisation\tLicence\tValidation Status\tEdit Status\tDate Last Edited\tLast Editor Name\tGroups Available in (GEMINI / MEDIN)\tRecord in Public view\n19274\tNRW_DS000001\tTemplate for Dataset Metadata in NRW 1.0 format\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-303030303031\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2024-09-25T15:18:56.000Z\tJohn Beattie\t-\tPrivate record\n19187\tNRW_DS000002\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2024-07-31T07:58:26.000Z\tJohn Beattie\t-\tPrivate record\n19184\tNRW_DS000003\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2024-08-02T13:13:52.000Z\tJohn Beattie\t-\tPublic record\n19186\tNRW_DS000004\t\t\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\tEditable\t2024-08-02T13:13:52.000Z\tJohn Beattie\t-\tPublic record\n17504\tNRW_DS100031\tLand Agency - Proposed Countryside Council for Wales (CCW) Holdings\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313030303331\tX:\\Ownership\\NRW Land\\Ex CCW land holdings proposed.lyr\tInternal Custodian and Metadata contact:  GIS and Spatial Data Team, NRW ( Hannah Brazier or Pippa Jones )\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\tUnknown\tNon-editable\t2025-02-04T12:00:51.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n"
